      "text": "Today I had a chance to visit the central immigration office in South Jakarta. Their services are excellent. I met with the lady called Dinda and a gentleman called in Intan The two persons were excellent. They tried to help me in a polite and excellent professional and unacceptable way thank you everybody in that office and may Allah bless you all.",
